IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TESTBLIM.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LIMIT-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-USED-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-AVAIL-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
COPY "BLIMP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Test 1: First valid consumption (200,000 of 1,000,000 limit)
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE "CONSUME" TO LIM-OP
    MOVE "CHANNEL" TO LIM-SCOPE
    MOVE "PIX" TO LIM-KEY
    MOVE "DAILY" TO LIM-PERIOD
    MOVE 200000.00 TO LIM-AMOUNT
    MOVE "BRL" TO LIM-CURRENCY
    CALL "BLIM" USING BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE LIM-USED TO WS-USED-ED
    MOVE LIM-AVAILABLE TO WS-AVAIL-ED
    DISPLAY "test=consume_valid_1 rc=" LIM-RC " used=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-USED-ED) " avail=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-AVAIL-ED)

    *> Test 2: Second valid consumption (300,000 -> total 500,000)
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE "CONSUME" TO LIM-OP
    MOVE "CHANNEL" TO LIM-SCOPE
    MOVE "PIX" TO LIM-KEY
    MOVE "DAILY" TO LIM-PERIOD
    MOVE 300000.00 TO LIM-AMOUNT
    MOVE "BRL" TO LIM-CURRENCY
    CALL "BLIM" USING BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE LIM-USED TO WS-USED-ED
    MOVE LIM-AVAILABLE TO WS-AVAIL-ED
    DISPLAY "test=consume_valid_2 rc=" LIM-RC " used=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-USED-ED) " avail=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-AVAIL-ED)

    *> Test 3: Over-limit consumption attempt (600,000 -> 500k + 600k = 1.1M > 1M limit)
    *> Must be REJECTED with RC 20 and must NOT persist the 1.1M to disk!
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE "CONSUME" TO LIM-OP
    MOVE "CHANNEL" TO LIM-SCOPE
    MOVE "PIX" TO LIM-KEY
    MOVE "DAILY" TO LIM-PERIOD
    MOVE 600000.00 TO LIM-AMOUNT
    MOVE "BRL" TO LIM-CURRENCY
    CALL "BLIM" USING BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE LIM-AVAILABLE TO WS-AVAIL-ED
    DISPLAY "test=consume_over_limit rc=" LIM-RC " msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(LIM-MSG) " avail=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-AVAIL-ED)

    *> Test 4: Subsequent valid consumption within headroom (400,000 -> 500k + 400k = 900k)
    *> If Test 3 had burned the limit on disk, this would falsely fail.
    *> With the fix, this succeeds and used becomes 900,000!
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE "CONSUME" TO LIM-OP
    MOVE "CHANNEL" TO LIM-SCOPE
    MOVE "PIX" TO LIM-KEY
    MOVE "DAILY" TO LIM-PERIOD
    MOVE 400000.00 TO LIM-AMOUNT
    MOVE "BRL" TO LIM-CURRENCY
    CALL "BLIM" USING BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE LIM-USED TO WS-USED-ED
    MOVE LIM-AVAILABLE TO WS-AVAIL-ED
    DISPLAY "test=headroom_preserved rc=" LIM-RC " used=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-USED-ED) " avail=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-AVAIL-ED)

    *> Test 5: Reversal / Release (release 400,000 -> used back to 500,000)
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE "RELEASE" TO LIM-OP
    MOVE "CHANNEL" TO LIM-SCOPE
    MOVE "PIX" TO LIM-KEY
    MOVE "DAILY" TO LIM-PERIOD
    MOVE 400000.00 TO LIM-AMOUNT
    MOVE "BRL" TO LIM-CURRENCY
    CALL "BLIM" USING BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE LIM-USED TO WS-USED-ED
    MOVE LIM-AVAILABLE TO WS-AVAIL-ED
    DISPLAY "test=release_usage rc=" LIM-RC " used=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-USED-ED) " avail=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-AVAIL-ED)

    *> Test 6: Check operation (check 100,000 on 500k used -> within limit)
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-LIM-REQ
    MOVE "CHECK" TO LIM-OP
    MOVE "CHANNEL" TO LIM-SCOPE
    MOVE "PIX" TO LIM-KEY
    MOVE "DAILY" TO LIM-PERIOD
    MOVE 100000.00 TO LIM-AMOUNT
    MOVE "BRL" TO LIM-CURRENCY
    CALL "BLIM" USING BK-LIM-REQ
    DISPLAY "test=check_within_limit rc=" LIM-RC " msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(LIM-MSG)

    GOBACK.
